;
; How Commons indexes one room in MYRA (commons_rules.h CR4): its number
; in the model's list (3 digits), its kind (0 this node's chat, 1 a group,
; 2 a space across nodes), the posts known there and the posts the owner
; has read (12 digits each) and its members (6 digits). Commons asks
; whether the numbers fit before it keeps a room.
^ZXCOMMONS(room:i3) = kind:i1! ^ newest:i12! ^ seen:i12! ^ members:i6!
